  "description": "Event store for .NET in which each decision declares its own consistency boundary as a query over event tags, rather than committing to an aggregate or stream up front. This package holds the core: the event log, tags and queries, the async control loop and its middleware chain, projections, and multi-tenancy. Add a backend to use it — Alberto.Postgres for production, Alberto.InMemory for tests. Pre-1.0 and under active testing; expect breaking changes.",
